    "description": "\ud83e\udd41 Feel the beat at your fingertips in the ultimate mobile drumming experience. WeDrum is a free drum pads simulator complete with every type of drum kit needed to become the master of the sticks! Discover how to play the drums in a real group. Take lessons in the app, or relax your mind with music & interactive drum games.\r\n\r\nDownload the best drum app out there, pick up the sticks, and get behind the digital drum set dreams are made of! Yes! Time to say hello to the only complete real drum set that fits right inside a pocket!\r\n\r\nPractice skills with realistic instruments to test out your abilities. Test out the real drum sounds to create a unique tone! \r\n\r\nNow it\u2019s time! Gather an awesome garage band team. Select a pianist, guitarist & vocalist to join the best group out there. Fan of the beats? Make a drumline with ease. \r\n\r\nJust for virtuosos?\r\nThis beat game is for everyone. Whether an instrument master looking to learn or relax with drum beat sounds, this <strong>music game</strong> is for everyone who loves music. Open the band app, then get started right away. Get every tool need to practice to Rockstar level. Discover audio pleasure from the comfort of \u2026 ANYWHERE! \r\n\r\nDeveloped by professional musicians for musicians, get access to:\r\n- Every instrument imaginable, from complete sets of equipment to life-like drum sets\r\n- Tons of popular songs for drumming to\r\n- Amazing variety of musical genres\r\n- A rocking drum game\r\n- Lesson tools to learn the art of the beat\r\n- Rock band features\r\n\r\n<strong>Unique AR Drum Set</strong>\r\nWith WeDrum, Discover the most realistic mobile real drum set with the power of Augmented Reality. Equipped with AR, build a kit from scratch \u2013 place those drums the way you like. Just tap GO to start drumming!\r\n\r\n<strong>\u25c6\u25c6\u25c6 Key features \u25c6\u25c6\u25c6</strong>\r\n\r\nSELECT: Choose a favorite song to play from a rich, varied catalog featuring a wide variety of genres and artists! New free songs are added to the Songbook regularly.\r\nBAND: Pick a pianist, a guitarist & a vocalist to get the real musical artist experience! Play solo or in a group!\r\nPLAY: Drum to the best songs by following dynamic hints & tips! Master the drums to rock out!\r\nACHIEVE: Keep up the tempo to earn the highest score ever! Hear the crowd cheering. That\u2019s what it feels like to be a real musician on stage! Perform an encore to better that score!\r\nSHARE: Make sure the world never misses a beat! Share the music-love with friends! Show off high scores on social media to become a master of the rhythm!\r\n\r\n<strong>\u25c6\u25c6\u25c6 More highlights \u25c6\u25c6\u25c6</strong>\r\n\r\nSOLO mode\r\nGo SOLO to jam out in freedom using an entirely realistic drum kit simulator. Experience HD sound, incredibly realistic graphics & more!\r\n\r\n<strong>What else is there?</strong>: \r\n\r\nLoads of drum sets to choose from!\r\n\ud83c\udfbc Jazz\r\n\ud83c\udfb5 Rock\r\n\ud83c\udfb6 Dance\r\n\ud83c\udfbc Electric Pads (Electronic or Beat Pads)\r\n\ud83c\udfb5 Ethnic drums (Congas and Bongos)\r\n\ud83c\udfb6 Japanese drums & Taiko are coming soon!\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd41 Advanced settings:\r\n- Mixing functionality to edit every sound!\r\n- Touch zones to learn each beat by heart\r\n- Drum stick animations\r\n- A metronome to never miss a beat\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd41 More rockin\u2019 features!:\r\n- Fastest response time without delays!\r\n- High-quality audio & individual sound settings for every drum set.\r\n- Each drum sound is recorded live by a professional!\r\n- Popular songs to learn & play!\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd41 WeDrum is the perfect tool to:\r\n- Learn to play the drums and electronic drum pads\r\n- Improve the sense of timing with exciting rhythm games\r\n- Traveling? Practice drums on the go\r\n- Spend free time playing awesome drumming games. Why not?\r\n\r\nNext Bonham, Grohl, or Starr? Gonna be world-famous? Or just keeping those fingers busy? How to play WeDrum is entirely up to you! Time to plunge into a world of drums, forge new skills, listen to great music & become a beat virtuoso!",
